      <activity id="dcfd9cfe-d0c2-5dbb-b13d-a6e7a7831e05" activityNameId="40e44cc3-a67b-5d9c-88c9-1cdd4f7109bd" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fuel cell Balance of Plant production, 1 kWe, proton exchange membrane (PEM)</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fuel cell Balance of Plant production, 1 kWe, proton exchange membrane (PEM)
LCI for a PEMFC fuel cell stack system. Operational time was set to 20,000 h at power of 1 kWe. Due to the degradation effects the hydrogen consumption must be increased to always generate the power of 1 kWe. In the case of dynamic operational regime 5 replacements (Nd = 5) of the PEMFC stack are included (lifetime of 3'800 hours per stack). Source: Rok Stropnik, Nejc Mlakar, Andrej LotriÄ�, Mihael SekavÄ�nik, Mitja Mori, The influence of degradation effects in proton exchange membrane fuel cells on life cycle assessment modelling and environmental impact indicators, International Journal of Hydrogen Energy, Volume 47, Issue 57, 2022, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2022.04.011

 UUID: dcd9b86a-2d28-3330-b508-1b020a61916a
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Literature data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: 
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dcd9b86a-2d28-3330-b508-1b020a61916a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
